<title>FINLAND: IVO FINALISES TELIVO SALE TO TELIA.</title>
<headline>IVO FINALISES TELIVO SALE TO TELIA.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish power group Imatran Voima (IVO) said in a statement on Monday the sale of 75 percent of its telecommunications unit Telivo to Swedish Telia had been completed in accordance with an earlier agreement.</p>
<p>&quot;Through the deal, Telia will enter the Finnish market with 10 percent of overseas calls and over four percent of long-distance calls,&quot; IVO said.</p>
<p>It did not state the value of the deal.</p>
<p>	  -- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0247</p>
